      "text": "Fifteen days among Ecuador’s most remarkable natural reserves: colonial Quito and the TelefériQo, the markets of Otavalo and the crater lake of Cuicocha, the páramo of El Ángel with its giant frailejones, the inhabited crater of Pululahua, the cloud forest of Bellavista and Mindo, Cotopaxi National Park, and four days at Sacha Lodge in the Amazon.",
